@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@requestId = paste-request-id-from-create-response-here

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health

### Proxy live opportunities from Supabase
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/opportunities

### Create a general enquiry
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "general",
  "name": "Example User",
  "email": "example@example.org",
  "subject": "Question about an opportunity",
  "message": "Please share more information."
}

### List requests created since this server started
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests

### Get one request
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}

### Update the request status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "resolved"
}

### Replace request status (PUT accepts the same status field)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "pending"
}

### Delete a request
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/requests/{{requestId}}
